  "description": "Haunted Hunt: Friday Night at Ravvy&#39;s is October 16th 2026 4-7pm. This Escape Room event is for All Ages - we have various escape room sessions that can scale up or down in scariness based on the age group. Volunteers can help set up, take down, be a storyteller (set the scene for participants), be a Scarer (spook or help the participants during the game), or a Game Leader (facilitate the escape room game in character). Mandatory volunteer meeting on October 15th time TBD to go over instructions. Please fill out google form linked.",
