  "eventID": 210624027,
  "template": "Master Submission Form Template",
  "title": "Harmony in Community",
  "description": "Join the Dispute Resolution Center of King County on Friday, October 16th for an unforgettable evening celebrating 40 years of building stronger communities through dialogue, understanding, and conflict resolution. Enjoy live music, heavy hors d&#39;oeuvres, and meaningful connections with people who believe in creating a more peaceful and connected King County. <br /><br />Our featured band is R E P O S A D O, a Latin-Funk-Afro-Soul collective dedicated to using the power of music to connect and transcend. <br /><br />Entertainment also includes American Flats, a rock and roll band with Americana and Punk influences that plays with a passion that is ageless, timeless, and electric.<br /><br />Whether you&#39;re discovering KCDRC for the first time or have been part of our journey for years, this community celebration is your opportunity to have fun, meet like-minded neighbors, and help build a future where everyone has the tools to resolve conflict constructively.",
